+ *     GPIO_PINn_INT_TYPE 1 rising, 2 falling, 3 any edge). A change of a pad's input level (the
+ *     GPIO_IN bit: the applied level, or its own output while driving) that matches its type sets
+ *     its GPIO_STATUS/STATUS1 bit while GPIO_PINn_INT_ENA enables the PRO (bit 2) or APP (bit 0)
